# No Git LFS here on purpose: Vercel's build clone does not fetch LFS objects
# by default, so LFS-tracked runtime assets (the draco decoder and the encrypted
# character model) would deploy as ~130-byte pointer files and the 3D scene
# would hang forever on "Loading". These assets are small enough to live as
# regular Git blobs.
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.wasm binary
*.glb binary
*.enc binary
*.hdr binary
